  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening our Schools</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the capacity of Jordan&apos;s public education system to provide quality and inclusive education for Syrian refugees and vulnerable Jordanians, while improving social cohesion in schools and within the community. The project activities include the provision of teacher training on child-centred interactive education and play-based learning methodologies, rehabilitation of learning spaces, community engagement and awareness sessions, and play-days for children.</narrative>
  </description>
